764
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:09,940
I'm trying to figure
out where that--

765
00:41:09,940 --> 00:41:10,648
PROFESSOR: It's--

766
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:15,100
ZACK: There.

767
00:41:15,100 --> 00:41:17,750
PROFESSOR: I think it's
