768
00:41:17,750 --> 00:41:18,250
Yeah.

769
00:41:18,250 --> 00:41:18,670
ZACK: Yeah.

770
00:41:18,670 --> 00:41:19,060
OK.

771
00:41:19,060 --> 00:41:19,935
How much do you want?

772
00:41:19,935 --> 00:41:21,340
PROFESSOR: 0.1.

773
00:41:21,340 --> 00:41:22,050
ZACK: OK.

774
00:41:22,050 --> 00:41:22,717
PROFESSOR: Yeah.

775
00:41:25,570 --> 00:41:26,070
OK.

776
00:41:26,070 --> 00:41:27,648
So I applied 0.1 of torque.

777
00:41:27,648 --> 00:41:29,940
Actually, we've got a sign
